# Pin line endings in the repository.
#
# Upstream standardises on LF - its ruff config sets `line-ending = "lf"`, and
# all 134 of its source files are LF. This machine's git has core.autocrlf=true,
# which would check those files out as CRLF and turn every later edit into a
# whole-file diff. Saying it here overrides that for everyone.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never touch their contents.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.pyd binary
